{"id":"5a23e63a72e2443c","group":"73","path":"73/73-df-binary-p.md","title":"Complexity Class P","display":"df-complexity-class-p — Complexity Class P","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-df-binary-p","aliases":["73-df-binary-p","73-df-complexity-class-p"],"display":"df-complexity-class-p — Complexity Class P","depends_on":["[[73-df-multitape-time-bounds]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-df-binary-p"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-df-binary-p</span><span>73-df-complexity-class-p</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-complexity-class-p — Complexity Class P"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"8658210215541698\" href=\"?note=8658210215541698\" title=\"73-df-multitape-time-bounds\">73-df-multitape-time-bounds</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{DTIME}\">\\(\\mathsf{DTIME}\\)</span> (deterministic time classes, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8658210215541698\" href=\"?note=8658210215541698\" title=\"73-df-multitape-time-bounds\">73-df-multitape-time-bounds</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}complexity\\text{-}class\\text{-}p}\\vdash\n\\mathsf P\\coloneqq\n\\bigcup_{k\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}}\\mathsf{DTIME}(n\\mapsto(n+1)^k)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}complexity\\text{-}class\\text{-}p}\\vdash\n\\mathsf P\\coloneqq\n\\bigcup_{k\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}}\\mathsf{DTIME}(n\\mapsto(n+1)^k)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>All languages are over the fixed binary alphabet; changing among standard deterministic multitape models changes time by at most a polynomial and therefore does not change <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf P\">\\(\\mathsf P\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>The shift by <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span> makes every displayed resource bound positive at input length <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span> without changing the asymptotic class.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-multitape-time-bounds","status":"resolved","id":"8658210215541698","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-multitape-time-bounds]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-multitape-time-bounds","status":"resolved","id":"8658210215541698","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathsf{DTIME}$ (deterministic time classes, see [[73-df-multitape-time-bounds]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathsf{DTIME}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}complexity\\text{-}class\\text{-}p}\\vdash\n\\mathsf P\\coloneqq\n\\bigcup_{k\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}}\\mathsf{DTIME}(n\\mapsto(n+1)^k)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf P","display":false},{"tex":"1","display":false},{"tex":"0","display":false}],"bytes":921,"backlinks":[{"id":"f083376270d496d8","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"25929fba481aa4a1","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["8658210215541698"]}